  "description": "The IVG Pro 2 Battery Device provides a reliable and stylish power source specifically engineered for the IVG Pro pod and refill container ecosystem. Housed within a minimalist, ergonomic chassis is a substantial 1000mAh built-in battery. This high-capacity battery is designed to deliver extended vaping sessions, potentially offering up to two days of use on a single charge for the average user, minimising the need for constant recharging. Staying ahead of the curve, the device features a sleek touch-screen display that functions as a clear, intuitive battery level indicator. This modern interface ensures you always know your current power status at a glance. Operation remains entirely user-friendly with draw-activated firing; simply inhale to vape, with no buttons or complex menus to navigate. This device is fully compatible with IVG Pro 2ml prefilled pods and their accompanying 10ml refill containers, which utilise mesh coils for exceptional flavour delivery. Setting up your device is effortless: click your chosen 2ml pod and 10ml container together, slide the combined unit into the opening of the Pro 2 battery, allow a moment for the coil to saturate, and you are ready to vape. Please note that this product is a standalone battery device. IVG Pro 12 pods, 10ml refill containers, and a USB Type-C charging cable are not included in the box and must be purchased separately to operate the device. Running low? There’s no need to replace the whole kit — just stock up on IVG Pro 12 refill pods . With 15 bold flavours to choose from, it’s easy to keep your vape fresh and satisfying: Shop IVG Pro 12 Refill Pods",
